WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960
Something I've been talking with a lot of people about lately is giving talks,

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.520
doing things on the side, presentations are really stressful and time-consuming sometimes.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.600
Even just like giving a PositConf talk, it takes a lot of your time and your effort.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.680
And so what are the benefits of that? What do you see from that? It's that exposure to people

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:22.160
seeing you do this work. Other people are probably doing it and not talking about it.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:26.000
If you do it and you talk about it, you put yourself out there in a really great way and

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.760
make all kinds of fantastic connections. And you don't even have to be the best or the brightest

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.360
or the most talented at something. If you're the one talking about it out loud and brave

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.919
enough to do that, you're the one who gets the opportunities.

